import json
h,w=16,26
g=[[0]*w for _ in range(h)]
blocks=[(3,2,3),(7,6,4),(7,10,4),(11,2,2),(11,6,2)]
for r0,c0,color in blocks:
    for r in range(r0,r0+4):
        for c in range(c0,c0+4):
            g[r][c]=color
assert len(g)==16 and all(len(row)==26 for row in g)
print(json.dumps({'action':'submit','grid':g},separators=(',',':')))

